#   media_parsing_1 - parsing media queries: query lists, <media-query>, <media-condition>
#                     and <media-feature>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/MediaParsing.cpp (lines 1-424): parse_as_media_query_list,
#       <media-query-list> (the template over TokenStream<T>), parse_as_media_query,
#       <media-query>, <media-condition> and <media-feature>. The lambdas of
#       parse_media_feature (<mf-name>, <mf-boolean>, <mf-plain>, <mf-comparison>, <mf-range>)
#       are the functions before it, with its local MediaFeatureName struct.
